# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`.

## Layout

- Soft white→greige intro: eyebrow, title, lead, blurb, CTA → kontakt (“Napsat o rituálu”)
- Continuous **feed of whole wedding posts** (same body as detail via `Posts/body.twig` + `Posts/parts.twig`)
- Greige bands separated by `.75rem` white gaps; slightly tighter padding than standalone `/svatebni-ritualy/{slug}`
- Title links to the standalone post URL (`linkedTitle`); no section eyebrow in the feed
- All published rituály posts in one response (~small corpus; no AJAX pager yet)
- No scroll / entrance animations on the index
